SUMMARY:Chris Dave X Eric Gales X MonoNeon X Cory Henry
LOCATION:Blue Note Los Angeles\, Hollywood
DESCRIPTION:Four visionary forces in modern music collide as Chris Dave\, E
 
ric Gales\, MonoNeon and Cory Henry unite for an explosive\, one-of-a-kind 
 
quartet experience. Chris Dave's groundbreaking rhythms\, Eric Gales' elect
 
rifying guitar work\, MonoNeon's unmistakable bass grooves\, and Cory Henry
 
's extraordinary keyboard mastery come together in a fearless fusion of fun
 
k\, blues\, rock\, jazz\, and experimental sound. Each artist is a musical 
 
powerhouse in their own right\, celebrated for pushing boundaries and redef
 
ining what's possible on their respective instruments. Together\, they crea
 
te an unpredictable sonic universe where deep grooves\, raw energy\, and fe
 
arless improvisation take center stage. Expect an electrifying night of ext
 
raordinary musical chemistry\, spontaneous interplay\, and virtuosic perfor
 
mances that defy genre and convention. With four master musicians sharing o
 
ne stage\, no two moments will ever be alike. More than a concert\, this is
 
 a rare meeting of creative minds\, a celebration of rhythm and raw express
 
ion\, and an opportunity to witness four innovators redefining what a moder
 
n power quartet can be. Prepare for an unforgettable night of groove\, grit
 
\, and musical fire. $20 Minimum Per Person Full Bar & Dinner Menu NO REFUN
 
DS OR EXCHANGES. All seating is first come\, first served. Bar Area seating
 
 is limited and first come first served. When all available seats are occup
 
ied\, the remaining bar area is standing room only. Table Seating is all ag
 
es\, Bar Area is 21+. Bar Area tickets for patrons under 21 will not be hon
 
ored. Group Reservations: Parties of 10 or more please contact us at events
 
@bluenotela.com or (310) 855-3750. We are not affiliated with any third-par
 
ty ticket sellers. Tickets purchased directly through our official website 
 
or TicketWeb are the only authorized sources. We cannot guarantee the valid
 
ity of tickets purchased through unauthorized sources. To protect against f
 
raud and unauthorized ticket sales\, management may require verification of
 
 the original purchase method\, including presenting the credit card used f
 
or purchase and matching photo identification upon entry. Tickets & info: h
 
ttps://www.ticketweb.com/event/chris-dave-x-eric-gales-blue-note-los-angele
 
s-tickets/14375784
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/chris-dave-x-eric-gales-blue-note-los-a
 
ngeles-tickets/14375784
END:VEVENT
